---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Sketch from '../components/Sketch.astro';
import { url } from '../i18n';
---

<!-- GitHub Pages serves one 404 for every URL, so it speaks both languages. -->
<Base lang="en" title="Folio missing · Χαμένο φύλλο">
  <div class="page missing">
    <Sketch name="lens" state="unfinished" class="art" />
    <p class="label">Errore 404</p>
    <h1>This folio has been torn from the codex.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Like many of Leonardo's pages, it's been lost along the way. The rest of the notebook is still here.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href={url('projects')}>Open the codex</a>
      <a class="button" href={url('')}>Home</a>
    </div>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <div lang="el" class="greek">
      <h2>Αυτό το φύλλο έχει σκιστεί από τον κώδικα.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Όπως πολλές σελίδες του Λεονάρντο, χάθηκε στην πορεία. Το υπόλοιπο σημειωματάριο είναι ακόμη εδώ.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={url('projects', 'el')}>Ανοίξτε τον κώδικα</a>
        <a class="button" href={url('', 'el')}>Αρχική</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .missing {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 18px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .missing :global(.art) {
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
  }
  .rule {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .greek {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .greek h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
</style>
